					"nextDialogs": [
						761190202
					],
					"speakerTitle": "努昂诺塔"
				},
				{
					"id": 761190202,
					"content": "对你来说，是不是太简单了？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761190203
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「少女」"
				},
				{
					"id": 761190203,
					"content": "如果下次再玩的话，我会试着让帽子们转得更快一点。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761190204
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「少女」"
				},
				{
					"id": 761190204,
					"content": "我有一个疑问！所以哥伦比娅刚才是怎么跟它们玩的呢？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761190205
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 761190205,
					"content": "不用月矩力的话就什么都看不见，用了的话未免又看得太清楚…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761190206
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 761190206,
					"content": "我可以睁开眼睛呀。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761190207
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「少女」"
				},
				{
					"id": 761190207,
					"content": "呃，这是我的盲点…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
